+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver, MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for its version numbering scheme. This decision superseded an earlier, short-lived selection of calendar versioning (CalVer), which was recorded and then explicitly changed in favor of semver; semver is therefore the scheme currently in effect for release tagging and compatibility signaling.
